    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d96">

                <pb facs="0219" n="189" xml:id="pg189"/>

                <head>96. Telegram From Operation PBSUCCESS Headquarters in
                        Florida to the CIA
                        Station in Guatemala<anchor n="1" xml:id="d96-f1"/></head>
                <dateline>[<hi rendition="#italic">place not declassified</hi>], <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1954-02-09T18:53:00+00:00">February 9, 1954,
                        1853Z</date>.</dateline>
                <p>451. Re: LINC 399.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d96-f2"
                    /></p>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>In accordance with ref, request ETA
                        Givloch soonest.</item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>Prior to trip, request Givloch confer with FMBLUG to obtain JMBLUG’s personal views on following: <list>
                            <label>A.</label>
                            <item>What political platform should an anti-Commie group, seeking to
                                overthrow WSBURNT Govt, espouse?
                                What should be announced position of such group on agrarian reform,
                                foreign capital, role of army, labor unions, nationalism,
                                etc.?</item>
                            <label>B.</label>
                            <item>What political actions must an anti-Commie group, once it has
                                seized power, carry out to remain in power? What should it actually
                                do on the planks contained in its pre-coup platform?</item>
                        </list></item>
                    <label>3.</label>
                    <item>Above is for LINCOLN guidance prior to shaping up
                            [<hi rendition="#italic">name not declassified</hi>]/Calligeris positive political
                        program.</item>
                    <label>4.</label>
                    <item>Dir FYI: Believe foregoing guidance
                        helpful and easily obtainable but not to be construed as any effort to
                        bypass ODACID.</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
